/P 140 0 R
/E (Everyone at school is getting super excited to see special characters come to life on stage, especially the animal roles like Pascal the chameleon and Maximus the horse. The cast is spending extra time after school practicing their movements, trying on colorful costumes, and making sure every scene looks real and entertaining. What makes this play so unique is how so many different talent from acting to diverse dance styles and live singing are brought together into one huge story. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (Taking on a production of this size comes with a great responsibility for everyone involved. Students and teachers alike are working hard to balance their busy class schedules, tests, and long rehearsal hours. The teachers are playing a major role in keeping things running, guiding student directors, singing for key parts, and making sure everyone stays on track. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
