/E (I THINK PROBABLY MOST OF US ALREADY KNOW HOW TO DO HOUSEHOLD CHORES, BUT SINCE THE PERIOD IS MOSTLY USELESS, I GUESS THEY COULD INCLUDE THAT. DO YOU THINK THIS WILL ACT AS AN ADDITIONAL BURDEN OVER ACADEMICS? IT'S A MIXED VIEW. PARENTS WOULD SAY THAT IT'S A VERY USEFUL ADDITION, BUT CURRENTLY THE STUDENTS, NO. IT WILL DEFINITELY HELP STUDENTS DEVELOP A CIVIC SENSE AND RESPONSIBILITY, BUT AT THE SAME TIME THEIR ACADEMICS ALSO MIGHT GO DOWN BECAUSE OF HAVING LESS TIME TO STUDY AND THE DISTRACTIONS AS WELL. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
